    "long_instructions": "## Generate Your Site Map\r\n\r\n<br/> 1. Plan out your prompt in `prompt.md` \r\n\r\n:::details [Not sure what to write?]\r\nModify this prompt:\r\n> Use my site map to create the HTML for my full website. Start with the Home page and include a navigation bar that links to all sections. Each section should have its own page.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n<br/> 2. Upload an image of your site map. Prompt AI to generate the HTML for your full website.\r\n\r\n<br/> 3. Double check what AI generated. Click through the nav bar to check that all pages connect back to each other and match your site map. If something is not right, reprompt AI and try again.",
